      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1755,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "Once again, I had such a great time, humans. I look forward to seeing you again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1757,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "^0000ffAs soon as the voice stopped talking, an irresistible force lifted and moved you somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1763,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe radiating crystal piece seems to beckon you, just like last time.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1765,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "[Mysterious Voice]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1766,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "I must have underestimated you... I didn't expect to see you again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1768,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "[Mysterious Voice]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1769,
      "npc" : "Lucid Crystal",
      "text" : "I can smell your sweat, hear the gasps of your exhaustion in combat. Ah~ The human desire for victory always excites me."
